    <informations>Shelly 1L Gen3 — schematic symbol.
Terminals, left to right as printed: S2 L O S1 Sx.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1l-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_b6848743f01d91431a7c4514b491dd0563c356f77b982985486b802150a0e563/Shelly%201L%20Gen3.png?cb=2c9434c037dd64e6b4e35323d70984eb
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_aa0cf42982e5309787878fcbeba0e4e86fb823f5f513a423b955d2dd5a030e11/1L-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=85d9287e3800c57b7adaf44429d59172
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_45f8a9bf938ec6c0b47f5b896e24a82dc7d43aa9d43c4cd58c269e6bd2b9796d/Shelly%201L%20Gen3%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=0d9e4abfa4be116371c33ac19268d414

Notes:
- Five terminal block, front-view photo confirms S2 at far left. No neutral screw.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
